<title>USA: Elbit to post Q4 gain from unit sale.</title>
<headline>Elbit to post Q4 gain from unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel-based Elbit Ltd said on Tuesday that it would post a gain of $1.2 million in the fourth quarter after shareholders approved the sale of a 51 percent stake of its Elbit - ATI Ltd shares to Foxboro Co.</p>
<p>Elbit said it would receive about $2.1 million in exchange for 25 percent of ATI's shares. It will pay $500,000 of the proceeds to buy technology used by ATI.</p>
</text>
